WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.330
Sumimura Yoshimori, a junior high student,
and Yukimura Tokine, a high school student,

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.170
must guard the land where
their school now stands

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.030
to protect the Karasumori Site
from the Ayakashi.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.070
It is a duty passed down to them
from generation to generation.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:21.620
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.490
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:28.690
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.590
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.030
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.430
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.970
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:45.310
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:50.970
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.480
Sha la la la la...

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:01.890
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.860
(Secret romance)

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:09.060
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.830
(A strange distance)

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:17.670
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:18.740
Yeah

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:22.210
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:25.810
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:31.150
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.560
Toshimori.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.200
Shuji-san.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:08.620
We're surrounded.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:11.860
Father, are they from the Kokuboro?

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.150
I would assume so.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:17.060
This is probably meant to keep me
and Tokiko at bay here!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.390
That would mean that Karasumori is...

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:24.500
Toshimori. I will go fight outside.
You can protect your father, right?

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.670
- Yes!
- What are you talking about?!

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:31.300
I can fight, too!
See? I made lots of talismans!

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.720
But you can't see the Ayakashi, right?

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.050
Well, uh, but I might be able to
somewhat see them vaguely

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.320
if I use my items and spells...

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.780
Anyway... neither of you
shall go outside!

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.220
I can handle the ones outside
on my own!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:55.290
I'm not one of you!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:58.530
Ketsu!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.210
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.000
Ketsu!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.250
Why, you!
You keep coming out of nowhere!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.470
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Metsu!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.410
All right!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:12.990
Come on.
You don't have any time to lose!

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.480
This is such a pain!

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.780
Ketsu!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:16.980
Metsu!

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.840
Are they the only ones
protecting Karasumori?

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:36.570
They have some backup members,
but these three are the main fighters.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:41.620
In other words. If we can
crush these three tonight,

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:45.480
the Princess will be able to
safely descend on Karasumori.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.850
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.520
Shishio! Stop getting in my way!

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.500
They're not working very well together.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:03.870
Did you do something to them, Byaku?

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:08.340
Half-Ayakashi tend to be
seen as monsters...

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.040
I simply took advantage of that.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.040
Ketsu! Metsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Metsu!

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:16.810
Ketsu!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.340
Tokine!

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.380
Yoshimori!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.910
Pace yourself! There has to be more
than these weaklings!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.760
You'll fall into their trap
if you use up your energy here!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:26.820
Yeah.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:31.330
Isn't it just a waste of time
sending in the weaklings?

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.530
We have to leave before daybreak.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.970
What is Gagin thinking?

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:42.170
I have explained that the recovery
of the Princess is our top priority.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.840
Whether or not he understood it
is another matter.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.940
I don't think he did.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.640
It doesn't look like
he's taking this seriously.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:54.080
The ones that are fighting don't seem to be
working under Gagin's orders.

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:58.330
They must be elated at
coming to Karasumori

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.120
and going wild on their own.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:05.000
So this is Karasumori!
I'm not gonna fight!

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:10.290
I'll just run around
so that I can power up!

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.400
Looks like it.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:18.540
Gagin doesn't have your leadership skills.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:26.680
I'm sure some won't listen to him.
However, his methods are always simple.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.590
Oh, my!
So many are getting destroyed!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:30.590
You wanna quit?

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.530
No! We can't let this chance slip us by!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:36.260
We have to power up
and then get out of here!

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:41.970
Time to time, he'll display
his overwhelming powers

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.440
to those who don't follow orders.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:47.930
What's going on?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.110
Everything he does is flashy.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.350
Are you the only ones here?

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:39.590
Two here and one over there...
Is that it?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:45.160
I'm asking if it's just you three kids
protecting Karasumori!

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.300
Isn't there anyone that's stronger?!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:52.970
Shut up! Excuse me for being a kid!
Yeah, we're the only ones here! So what?!

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:58.110
What the hell?! I'm here to kill!
Stop screwing around!

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:02.350
Hey, I thought the plan was
to disperse the enemy's forces

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.250
to decrease the security
of Karasumori, right?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:09.150
I won't purposely say something
to bring down Gagin's morale.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.990
But it's gone down already.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.430
I'm so sad.
I can't see through my tears.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.490
Gagin-sama! Shall we take your place?

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:25.100
No. Make the weaklings retreat.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.440
None of them will listen to us.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:32.940
They're all nothing but eyesores!

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.240
What?! He's burning his own allies!

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:44.620
Come on. Retreat!
You'll get hurt if you don't!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.490
He's not mentally stable!
Don't disobey him!

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:56.030
Oh. Fine. The Princess doesn't
have a lot of time.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.890
Let's make this quick.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:07:59.430
Princess?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.340
That idiot... Blubbering like that!

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:08.050
But it seems that he does understand
the most important thing here,

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:11.310
that he needs to finish this quickly!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:21.690
Ketsu!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.000
Yoshimori!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.160
It's all right! I can deflect it!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.480
It didn't work huh.

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:55.820
After the boy deflected the first fireball,
they jumped up using the girl's Kekkai.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:00.590
The other kid waited for the right time
and threw the tree.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:13.980
Sorry. I underestimated you all.
Looks like I can fight a bit more seriously.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.820
That's great.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:20.950
But I don't like the idea
of throwing trees!

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.590
Fighting is supposed
to be done with fists.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.990
The impact makes it fun!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.390
Come at me with all you've got.

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:33.870
If you don't,
you'll be charred in an instant!

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:38.230
I won't let you keep your distance!

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:42.530
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.370
Ketsu!
Metsu!

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:47.770
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.240
Ketsu! Ketsu!
Metsu!

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.890
Dad, your talismans are working.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:57.180
Really?!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.390
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:01.720
Metsu!

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.360
Yay! I could cast Metsu!

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.920
Good job, Toshimori! You did it!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.400
Are they roaches?

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.810
They keep coming no matter
how many I destroy!

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.540
But it's strange...

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:21.640
There's just as many over there,
but the Yukimura hag isn't coming out.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:29.350
What Negative Energy!
What is happening in Karasumori?!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.300
This form is much easier
to move around in!

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:54.850
That flame... I can feel the heat
from this far away...

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.480
But I'm also shivering...
What is this?!

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:03.760
Oh, man. I think Gagin could
take them on without transforming.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.490
It should end very soon.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:09.790
Oh, really?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.730
The Negative Energy is off the charts!

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:20.370
The biggest problem is the heat.
I don't know if I can even get close.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:26.040
If I can avoid the first strike,
with my speed...

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.440
...I can do it!

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:31.370
Who will he attack?

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:35.350
Ketsu!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.010
Both of us huh?!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.250
He's fast!

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.840
Damn it!
My leg almost got blown off!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.910
I'm healing faster. That's for sure.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:10.250
The Princess is sure to
recover her energy!

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:15.930
Of course, I don't need more energy
than I already have.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:16.720
Ketsu!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:21.590
Metsu!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.240
I can't destroy him?!
I can't take him out with my Kekkai!

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.270
It looks like piercing him
will be difficult, too!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.880
That hardness and that speed...
Is he a monster?!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.050
I put all my strength into it!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:45.960
What am I supposed to do against
someone outrageous like this?!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:49.260
Now then... what should I do?

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:06.680
It's fast, I can avoid it! But...

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:08.610
Damn it!

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:09.680
Ketsu!

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:16.050
I knew it. The Half-Ayakashi kid
is more fun to fight!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:19.560
Damn it!
Why's he only attacking Shishio?!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.530
Shut up and back him up!
You stop the fireballs!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.720
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:28.130
Yoshimori, try to deflect it back
to that horse face if you can!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.960
I can't! He keeps running around!

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:34.440
Then shoot it up!
Don't direct it at the city!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.560
Got it!

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.210
Whoa!

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:49.020
Gagin keeps aiming for the kid that fights
with hand-to-hand combat.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:54.530
Byaku, what did you do to that kid?
He doesn't look any weaker.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:58.490
I gave him an egg.
An egg of a small insect.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:04.800
It will hatch soon. When that time comes.
The kid will become one of us!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.140
In other words. Karasumori will be ours!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.250
I have to do more than just dodge!

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:18.810
Can you protect Karasumori
for a little longer until I arrive?

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:20.820
I'm counting on you.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.030
Oh, my...

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.130
This is going to take a while.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.660
What are you doing?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:48.340
You're getting hurt but
are they going to thank you for it?

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.310
Who are you doing this for?!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.880
Who will thank you for what you do?

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.980
You talk too much!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.830
Come on. Don't tell me
you're giving up already.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:11.790
Come on!

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:17.870
You sure I can go all out?!

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:19.950
The flame changed!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.340
Here!

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.950
Get ready!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.020
Take this!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:25.680
What?!

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:27.250
Ketsu!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:41.100
You took it head-on and deflected it...
Nice! This makes it all the more fun!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.390
Damn it! He's too strong!

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:47.040
I have to transform completely
to fight against him!

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:47.970
But!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.870
The next time you go out of control,
you're done for.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.650
I might not be able to stay with
the Night Troops anymore.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.370
Idiot! Why aren't you running away?!

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:58.540
Get away!

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:01.710
But you... Your arms!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.450
I'm not the same as you!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.860
Wow! I didn't think I would heal this fast!

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.400
I knew they'd freak out.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:20.470
You idiot! Just because
you can heal doesn't mean-

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.900
Take this! All three of you!

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:31.580
Gagin wants to take care of them
by brute force.

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.580
And look at that face.
He's enjoying this.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:38.410
I wonder if those kids can withstand it.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.000
I can't hold it off anymore!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.660
Ketsu!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:48.790
Ketsu!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:55.130
Are you sure you want to let
Gagin do this his way?

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:59.110
If he causes too much of a ruckus.
Won't the Night Troops come out?

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:03.240
Right now, their hands are tied
with something else.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.810
Oh?

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:21.890
Crush them all at once!
Don't let even one escape!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.590
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:43.710
If they see my true form,
even they would...

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:46.430
All right! We can still keep it up!

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:49.930
Yeah! If we can hold off a little more.
Reinforcements will come to help us!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.590
Reinforcements would already
be here if they could.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.330
Nobody is coming!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.230
I have to transform completely!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:05.640
But I don't know if I can
maintain my sanity when I do!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:10.250
I might end up hurting them!

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:11.340
But...

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:16.350
But I have to transform completely
to fight a monster like that.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:21.360
So you've decided?
We will welcome you.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:26.120
No one will hate you.
No one will deny you.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:30.530
Just take a step towards us.
Your pain and suffering will end.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:37.640
You always belonged to this side.
Now, come. Cross over the boundary!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:46.920
It looks hopeless. Yoshimori is at
his limit just being on the defensive.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.350
They don't even have a chance to attack.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.420
You go get Tokiko! I'll get Shigemori!

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:55.730
Tokiko is gone.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:56.990
What did you say?!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.000
She went to find the path
to the Kokuboro.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.830
Bad timing!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:07.730
Hakubi, let's go! We have to
create a chance for them to attack!

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:11.040
Hey, you really want to get yourself
in that tough mess?

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.440
Of course! Did you forget?

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:17.880
We were ordered by Master Tokimori
to protect Karasumori!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.250
I guess that's true!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.280
Wait, but the only weapon we have
is our sense of smell.

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:25.830
Damn it! Just come on!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:26.880
Y-Yeah!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.060
Hey, you horse face!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.900
Stop messing around
with women and children!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.200
Come on!
Can you follow our movements, horse face?

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:43.830
Damn it!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:46.210
His attack stopped!

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:47.880
This way, horsey!

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.910
Madarao and Hakubi are helping out!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.720
Hey! Both of you stay back!

00:19:58.190 --> 00:20:00.680
I'm going to transform
all the way and fight him!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.280
What are you saying?!

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.020
If you do that-!

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.830
You're in my way! Get lost!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.170
Wait! Why do you always-!

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:11.260
Can't you see how strong he is?!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.870
It takes a monster to defeat a monster!

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:17.640
You're wrong!

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:18.800
What?!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.950
You're not a monster!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.910
What are you risking your life for?

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:29.290
To protect others, right?!
Monsters don't do that!

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:33.090
You have the heart of a human.
Not a monster!

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:36.690
Right?

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:47.980
You annoying little flies!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.910
We haven't been alive
500 years for nothing!

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:53.680
Except I'm about 100 years younger!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.980
You weaklings!

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:05.320
I wanted to play a little longer
but I should end it now.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.290
What is he trying to do?!

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.430
Can't you see?
He's trying to finish us off!

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:10.960
Hey, Shishio!

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:15.360
You're really naïve.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.030
He smiled?

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:26.710
I'm sorry, Chief...
I couldn't obey your orders.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:31.240
Are you sure about this?
He's going to transform.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.750
He's transforming into an Ayakashi.
He will become one of us!

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:38.920
Now Karasumori will be ours!

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:52.490
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:54.370 --> 00:23:00.400
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:02.940
"What nerve"

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:06.310
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:10.040
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:16.420
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:21.460
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:23.400
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:23.430 --> 00:23:28.660
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:32.190
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:36.300
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:50.790 --> 00:24:01.130
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
